OL,3,GSouth West                             
OL,5,CFriday:FShowers across the region      
OL,6,Fbegin to dissipate by mid afternoon.   
OL,7,FCloud gradually clearing by late       
OL,8,Fevening as temperatures drop overnight 
OL,9,Fwith localised frosts.                 
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCold   
OL,12,FSaturday morning with localised frost, 
OL,13,Fotherwise a dry and bright day for     
OL,14,Fmost. Rain approaches the far south    
OL,15,Fwest Saturday afternoon, as winds      
OL,16,Fincrease and unsettled weather         
OL,17,Fdominates again.                       
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
